  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a user, I want Halloween themes in October — a quiet one switched on for me and an over-the-top orange, black and purple one — announced by a witch, a ghost or a bat and swept away by a witch, so that October feels special in the app.\n\nOperator request of 2026-10-28 (« Thème Samain »). M4; first window October 2027 (the 2026 one has passed).\n\n### Blocked by\n\n- #256\n- #729\n\n\n### Scope\n\nReuses LOT-166's seasonal engine; windows and rules in [`docs/THEMES.md`](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/THEMES.md) §4–§5.\n\n- **Spooktober soft** (light, dark): a bit of spider web, a candelabra, a small bat (visible on the dark variant: grey or violet, operator 10:09 E); crossing items every 20–90 min (never less than 20): ghost, witch on a broom, lightning = 5 flashes of about 0.3 s at random places within 3 s.\n- **Spooktober abusé** (single variant): lots of Halloween colours and drawings, dominant orange, black, purple. Needs LOT-188.\n- **Window**: selectable 01/10–31/10; Spooktober soft switched on at the first launch 01/10–31/10 unless opted out that year.\n- **Arrival**: first launch 01/10–31/10, a witch on a broom, a ghost or a bat/vampire (random) crosses the screen (≥ 1/5 of the screen, « slightly bigger », operator 10:09 D), then « Spooktober est là ! Thème disponible dans les réglages » [OK] [Désactiver].\n- **Packing**: first launch from 01/11 (operator 2026-10-28 04:45) within 7 days, if a Samain theme is active: a witch sweeps the decorations away (≤ 5 s), « Allez on remballe »; later, silent restore.\n- Art in the charter of THEMES.md §6; drawings as on the reference boards in [`docs/assets/themes/`](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/tree/dev-swift/docs/assets/themes) (validated by the operator, 2026-11-10).\n\n### Legacy counterpart\n\nNone @ 87fe0d1c (legacy has no Halloween theme). New GAP row (gap-new, id = this issue), class `b·operator`.\n\n### Depends on\n\n- LOT-166 (#256), LOT-188 (#?) for Spooktober abusé\n\n### Model\n\nSonnet 5.5 → Opus 5.5 (the engine is LOT-166's); Mac session for the art.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Calendar tests: 30/09, 01/10, 31/10, 01/11 and 07/11 (packing), 08/11 (silent), opt-out, manual pick, Reduce Motion, « Animations de saison » off.\n- [ ] Lightning: 5 flashes ≤ 3 s, one light haptic through `HapticFeedback.live`; none with Reduce Motion.\n- [ ] Bat and every decoration on the dark variant ≥ 3:1 against its background (WCAG 1.4.11).\n- [ ] Same quality criteria as LOT-166 (tests shown to fail without the change, Instruments numbers, iPhone / iPad / Duo, French strings, no new dependency).\n\n### Before you start (agents and humans)\n\nRead AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/THEMES.md, the LOT-166 spec. Claim with `/claim <session-id>`; PR body `LOT-191`, `Closes #<this issue>`, `Claim: <session-id>`.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
