   "body": "/claim mac/mac-mbp\n\nOperator priority (2026-11-28). Plan (`docs/THEMES.md` is the contract, §6 season rules):\n- Read the issue and the spec; the two Spooktober themes as theme data (like #1369), the crossing items and the witch sweep as seasonal decorations (like Noël and LOT-194 #1438).\n- Art from `docs/assets/themes/` only; missing art listed, never invented.\n- Tests red first (contrast, dated window with an injected calendar, Reduce Motion).\n- Draft PR, Opus review (author Sonnet).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
